The reviewed correspondence includes internal/oauth/device.go,
internal/oauth/import_usage.go, and internal/oauth/oauth.go. These files adapt
OAuth/device-login and account-import behavior to Ferry's local interfaces,
credential handling and persistence. The exact original import revision is not
asserted; the reviewed upstream snapshot is recorded in
LICENSES/CLIProxyAPI/source.json.

