has not been rewritten. This attribution does not imply upstream endorsement.

Additional runtime dependency and container notices are provided in LICENSES/,
docs/third-party-notices.md and docs/container-notices.md.

Feather
https://github.com/feathericons/feather

The inline console settings icon has structural correspondence with Feather's
settings icon. The MIT notice is conservatively retained in
LICENSES/Feather/LICENSE; the reviewed reference is recorded in source.json.
The local path uses different coordinates and gear-outline segments. This does
not assert an original import revision or attribute the Ferry brand to Feather.

Native provider integration also references/adapts CLIProxyAPI snapshot
d946c4fba6fc9a5cfbca1f3d85184d62ad2fb683. File-level source comments and MIT
notices are retained in internal/nativeauth and internal/nativewire; the reviewed
file list is recorded in LICENSES/CLIProxyAPI/native-source.json. The upstream
MIT license at this snapshot matches the preserved LICENSE byte for byte.

